      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>The Journey Pack gives you everything to succeed:</p><ul><li><p>1 Lio Diffuser - your new healthy hand-to-mouth habit</p></li><li><p>18 Natural Flavor Cores - 60 days of craving relief</p></li><li><p>Step-by-step quit guide - no guesswork, just results</p></li><li><p>Custom Habit Tracker - to keep you on track</p></li><li><p>30-day guarantee - because your success matters</p></li></ul><p>It’s time to replace cigarettes with something that actually helps you quit.</p>"
